    "detailed_description": "<strong>Story</strong><br>You are a part-time tutor and your student confesses to you that he loves you.<br>When you agree, she begs you to kiss her...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924550/extras/77a65c6f5ceb0964401c40e99359430b.avif?t=1664299671\" /></div><br><br><strong>Character</strong><br>Yuka Tachibana<br>{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/Chara.png<br>Your student.<br>Loves you! She has an honest and energetic personality.<br><br>You<br>A college student who works part-time as a private tutor.<br><br><strong>Feature</strong><br><br><strong>\u30fbYour choices will change the story and what you play!</strong><br>In some cases, you may end up not having feelings for each other...<br><br><strong>\u30fbVR mode is on board!</strong><br>VR allows for a more immersive experience.<br><br><strong>\u30fbYou can move the camera freely!</strong><br>In desktop mode, you can view the character from any angle you like!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924550/extras/dc5b4ade4516f3e207eb5b15358d4ad1.avif?t=1664299671\" /></div><br><br><strong>\u30fbChangeable appearance!</strong><br>You can change the character to the color of your choice!<br>Please choose your favorite appearance.<br>You can also change your own skin color.<br><br><strong>\u30fbThere are six kinds of play!</strong><br>There are kissing (plus ear licking), fellatio, back, sitting facing each other, normal position, and cowgirl position.<br><br><strong>\u30fbFine expressions</strong><br><br><strong>\u30fbManual mode is available! (VR mode only)</strong><br>The girl moves according to your controller movements!",
